    "_enabled": true,
    "_fontFamily": "Arial",
    "_isSystemFontUsed": true,
    "_N$string": "  Each fruit pattern has two possibilities. If there is an odds number under the winning pattern, the payout will be based on the number in the pattern, otherwise the payout will be based on the default odds.\nx2\n\nx2\n\nx2\n\nx2\n\nDefault odds for fruits\n\nx3\n\nx6\n\nx8\n\nx12\n\nx30\n\nSpecial bonus",
